  (text "USB-C J1\nNative USB Serial/JTAG on GPIO13/14 for flashing and logs; no USB-UART bridge.\nCC 5.1k Rd = sink. Shell floating, same as ControlBoard2027.\nD2 surge clamp and F1 PTC on VBUS; VBUS feeds only the U4 LDO.\nDESIGN_NOTES.md §4."
    (at 71.12 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8efa979c-2771-4cfa-9485-febe7f9d9b18")
  )
  (text "USB-C J1: TVS, FUSE, CC, ESD"
    (at 69.85 96.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cca5b3c7-9543-4cbc-8af5-cea250b5ed0f")
  )
  (text "ROUTING - USB\nUSB_DP/USB_DN 90R differential, in parallel at equal length. Join A6/B6 and A7/B7 at J1.\nU2 right at J1, D2 right at J1 VBUS, short GND vias."
    (at 71.12 208.28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 255 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "31ae9f7f-d8f5-4a89-bfa4-ba7768919682")
  )
